{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14042","headline":"奉和元承杪秋忆终南旧居 · 耿湋","name":"奉和元承杪秋忆终南旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白玉郎仍少，羊车上路平。\n秋风摇远草，旧业起高情。\n乱树通秦苑，重原接杜城。\n溪云随暮淡，野水带寒清。\n广树留峯翠，闲门响叶声。\n近樵应已烧，多稼又新成。\n解佩从休沐，承家岂退耕。\n恭侯有遗躅，何事学泉明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}